# Dart in this app

- Services stay singletons: `ClassName._()` and `static final instance`.
- After `await` in a `State`, return when `!mounted` before `setState` or `Navigator`.
- Reuse the existing user-facing sentences. Do not add a second message for the same failure.
- `AppUser.fromLoginJson` leaves `fcmToken` empty. Only `FcmService.syncToken` writes the device token.
- One `user` row: `saveUser` deletes, then inserts. Do not query multiple users.
- Extend `test/login_result_test.dart` or `test/school_branding_test.dart` when the behavior is a pure function.

```dart
// After an await in State
final user = await DatabaseService.instance.getUser();
if (!mounted) return;
setState(() => _userLabel = user?.displayName);
```
